": "labels", "origin": "prediction-changed"}, {"original_width": 640, "original_height": 360, "image_rotation": 0, "value": {"x": 14.167139175257764, "y": 62.20000000000072, "width": 69.35670103092819, "height": 5.800000000000062, "rotation": 0, "text": ["t_A \u2261 \u03b3\u03c9_B,1 + \u03c9_B,2 \u2212 \u03b3x^*_B,1 \u2212 x^*_B,2 < 0 t_B \u2261 \u03b3x^*_B,1 + x^*_B,2 \u2212 \u03b3\u03c9_B,1 \u2212 \u03c9_B,2 = \u2212t_A > 0"]}, "id": "BB_4", "from_name": "transcription", "to_name": "image", "type": "textarea", "origin": "prediction-changed"}, {"original_width": 640, "original_height": 360, "image_rotation": 0, "value": {"x": 14.2, "y": 70.2, "width": 69.8, "height": 24.8, "rotation": 0}, "id": "BB_5", "from_name": "bbox", "to_name": "image", "type": "rectangle", "origin": "prediction"}, {"original_width": 640, "original_height": 360, "image_rotation": 0, "value": {"x": 14.2, "y": 70.2, "width": 69.8, "height": 24.8, "rotation": 0, "labels": ["text"]}, "id": "BB_5", "from_name": "label", "to_name": "image", "type": "labels", "origin": "prediction"}, {"original_width": 640, "original_height": 360, "image_rotation": 0, "value": {"x": 14.2, "y": 70.2, "width": 69.8, "height": 24.8, "rotation": 0, "text": ["since the initial Pareto allocation ((x^*_A,1 , x^*_A,2), (x^*_B,1 , x^*_B,2)) is feasible. With such transfers, is easy to see that this allocation would in fact be a price equilibrium with transfers! This construction can be replicated for all Pareto optimal allocations: i.e. by making transfers, any target Pareto optimal allocation can be implemented as a competitive equilibrium."]}, "id": "BB_5", "from_name": "transcription", "to_name": "image", "type": "textarea", "origin": "prediction"}, {"original_width": 640, "original_height": 360, "image_rotation": 0, "value": {"x": 42.026417525773205, "y": 1.1597938144329898, "width": 7.103737113402062, "height": 2.835051546391753, "rotation": 0}, "id": "hPtCIbLt53", "from_name": "bbox", "to_name": "image", "type": "recta